# The working queue. Development notes, not something a user installing the app
# has any use for - and it is where the only leak of the user's own listening
# data into a tracked file happened. It stays on disk, untracked, and is read
# at the start of every session.
/HANDOFF.md

# Working documents, not for people installing or packaging the app. They stay
# on disk and out of the repository: machine-specific test scripts, the frozen
# session spec with the development hardware in it, the design review page, and
# the packaging plan, which records decisions in the first person.
docs/DEBIAN-FIRST-RUN.md
docs/SPEC-0.4.0.md
docs/design-review.html
docs/PACKAGING.md
